{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-9-36","kind":"proposition","title":"欧几里得完全数构造","englishTitle":"If as many numbers as we please beginning from an unit be set out continuously in double proportion, until the sum of all becomes prime, and if the sum multiplied into the last make some number, the product will be perfect.","book":9,"number":36,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.36","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:9.prop.36/","group":"prop","sourceNumber":36,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","contentId":"euclid-9-36","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7ee328a98df85a96dbbf1882afee0874f732ebea6a5aaecaddecc60f9c046951","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-9-36.statement","euclid-9-36.construction.1","euclid-9-36.proof.1","euclid-9-36.proof.2","euclid-9-36.proof.3","euclid-9-36.proof.4","euclid-9-36.proof.5","euclid-9-36.proof.6","euclid-9-36.proof.7","euclid-9-36.proof.8","euclid-9-36.proof.9","euclid-9-36.proof.10","euclid-9-36.proof.11","euclid-9-36.proof.12","euclid-9-36.proof.13","euclid-9-36.proof.14","euclid-9-36.proof.15","euclid-9-36.proof.16","euclid-9-36.proof.17","euclid-9-36.proof.18","euclid-9-36.proof.19","euclid-9-36.proof.20","euclid-9-36.proof.21","euclid-9-36.proof.22","euclid-9-36.construction.2","euclid-9-36.proof.23","euclid-9-36.proof.24","euclid-9-36.proof.25","euclid-9-36.proof.26","euclid-9-36.proof.27","euclid-9-36.proof.28","euclid-9-36.proof.29","euclid-9-36.conclusion","euclid-9-36.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-9-36.statement","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"f45b05b3ba00dade3b6582adebf438854ebff0e5272e5fdce562c0cc9d7542b5","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"If as many numbers as we please beginning from an unit be set out continuously in double proportion, until the sum of all becomes prime, and if the sum multiplied into the last make some number, the product will be perfect."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果从单位开始的数值以双倍的比例连续排列,直到所有数字的总和成为正数,如果总和乘以最后一个数字,产品将是完美的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8ee6c4dfbb0f4f526f95b10673fa3a70d719b0c0f951edb5b87cfa8402ec89e0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let as many numbers as we please, A, B, C, D, beginning from an unit be set out in double proportion, until the sum of all becomes prime, let E be equal to the sum, and let E by multiplying D make FG; I say that FG is perfect."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"不论我们有多少数字,A,B,C,D,从单位开始,以双倍比例排列,直到所有数字达到最高,E等于E和D的总数,FG的产值达到FG;我说,FG是完美的。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c30ff1bcdc61050d6c1382d4025d99de69a59420c9d106c056efa8dcec76abd9","citations":["euclid-7-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, however many A, B, C, D are in multitude, let so many E, HK, L, M be taken in double proportion beginning from E; therefore, ex aequali, as A is to D, so is E to M. [[VII. 14](/principles/euclid-7-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"然而,由于A、B、C、D众多,因此从E起,E、HK、L、M的比例要加倍;因此,在平等的基础上,A至D的比例等于E至M的比例；A 与 D 之比等于 E 与 M 之比。 [[VII. 14](/principles/euclid-7-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":3,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6f4806433b56c04579beced1ebed91f867cb4422d9a7e24308de44d0c0ca0461","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the product of E, D is equal to the product of A, M. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,E,D的产值等于A,M的产值。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"605d97bcdfd9f3dcd87de18361841003faff911527b80eea80c30c4f968cd97a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And the product of E, D is FG; therefore the product of A, M is also FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E,D的产物是FG,A,M的产物也是FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e1d7f55d5c03ef3f19ef809d548a87bba8066a3a03f9fe8300ac5b1d3f5466cb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A by multiplying M has made FG; therefore M measures FG according to the units in A."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A乘以M,使FG;因此,根据A的单位,M,整除,FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"062651f3442b15ecd113c52f1301d74498b0e0264433eb551463e7f60f716cdd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And A is a dyad; therefore FG is double of M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A是一头牛,FG是M的两倍。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c1894f809be653b43d15a0ebdd5ee33c4e34096f18566957d3f2fe7448be2069","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But M, L, HK, E are continuously double of each other; therefore E, HK, L, M, FG are continuously proportional in double proportion."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但M,L,HK,E之间不断翻一番;因此,E,HK,L,M,FG之间持续达到2倍的比例。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"35dd5d86d07d9c384de64108ca4f692d10f2d9182535daad1b1771a7d1f7e4c9","citations":["euclid-9-35"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now let there be subtracted from the second HK and the last FG the numbers HN, FO, each equal to the first E; therefore, as the excess of the second is to the first, so is the excess of the last to all those before it. [[IX. 35](/principles/euclid-9-35)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在,从第二个HK和最后一个FG数字中减去HN,FO, 每一数字等于第一个E;因此,第二比第一个多出的比等于最后一个多出与所有前一个比。 [[IX. 35](/principles/euclid-9-35)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3992401013361edc46b277419cd6e128b990f41d0aea8720073eb127118d2664","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as NK is to E, so is OG to M, L, KH, E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,NK对E的比等于OG对M、L、KH和E的比；NK 与 E 之比等于 OG 与 M 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"30202b6ff696df8a0a0065e8c4dff772bdcc04f87f12b28445e4cb1a74d76777","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And NK is equal to E; therefore OG is also equal to M, L, HK, E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"NK等于E,OG等于M,L,HK,E。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88ae254c754bf5f35494ad9a6ee8913a4d734252a2d38e142ebb5938796f6517","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But FO is also equal to E, and E is equal to A, B, C, D and the unit."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但FO也等于E,E等于A、B、C、D和单位。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3212dafb6ae368a15064cef647d2798cb4cc2f570a408080a3d0ca680570a75d","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the whole FG is equal to E, HK, L, M and A, B, C, D and the unit; and it is measured by them."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,整个FG等于E、HK、L、M和A、B、C、D和单位;由它们来计量。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"638e19ceafc07a95d736d72ccd633d0bcdb847e826feff5395a9a3e932168ab6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"I say also that FG will not be measured by any other number except A, B, C, D, E, HK, L, M and the unit."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"我还指出,除A、B、C、D、E、HK、L、M和单位外,FG将不以任何其他数字计量。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"3c7f798fd8fb9e94ac3c6b2b051fa767da54980fd17c6ea390d9f78209cb23de","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if possible, let some number P measure FG, and let P not be the same with any of the numbers A, B, C, D, E, HK, L, M."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果可能的话,让P 整除 FG和P数字与A B、C、D、E、HK、L、M数字中任何一个数字不同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"55b2b899783678eedc7ec49314f1a9171556ed5422778f4a81492141a9ddf929","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, as many times as P measures FG, so many units let there be in Q; therefore Q by multiplying P has made FG."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"还有 P 整除 FG乘以多少倍这么多单位,Q;因此,Q乘以P 使FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"be7350ba991d62a07cec06a4cf006352cc032440b2abd05176d4b88919f29ca7","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, further, E has also by multiplying D made FG; therefore, as E is to Q, so is P to D. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,E乘以D乘以FG;因此,E与Q之比等于P与D之比；E 与 Q 之比等于 P 与 D 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8d2ab7b98d453510511bbfe423457d493323e2fafccee9d52464635b1f7cbe97","citations":["euclid-9-13"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, since A, B, C, D are continuously proportional beginning from an unit, therefore D will not be measured by any other number except A, B, C. [[IX. 13](/principles/euclid-9-13)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B,C,D 持续成比例 从单位开始, 因此D 将不用任何其他数字整除, 除了A,B,C。 [[IX. 13](/principles/euclid-9-13)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"71927c8ba977437c5964fde1ad0a02362864bdb60bc563841c1028eb61e4c74e","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, by hypothesis, P is not the same with any of the numbers A, B, C; therefore P will not measure D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"假设P和A,B,C之间 都不一样,因此P不会整除,D。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.18","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 18","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"b41d10c0e9f8ea35a09537c1c208d96e24c4fcd2789ed9a35331211a4c4608e5","citations":["euclid-7-def-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But, as P is to D, so is E to Q; therefore neither does E measure Q. [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但是,P对D的比等于E对Q的比;因此,E对整除对Q的比也不等于E对Q的比；P 与 D 之比等于 E 与 Q 之比。 [[VII. Def. 20](/principles/euclid-7-def-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.19","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":20,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 19","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5e111037b19862d2663b3d6f4d961ed5304b9882e1bbe646802ec71ceb94bec0","citations":["euclid-7-29"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And E is prime; and any prime number is prime to any number which it does not measure. [[VII. 29](/principles/euclid-7-29)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"E是第一位的, 任何素数是第一位的, 任何数量,它不是整除。 [[VII. 29](/principles/euclid-7-29)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.20","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":21,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 20","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"cdeb6b47c0d237c664b5dd049a8281bdd5fa723223048a85bafb5c35449cbcf9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore E, Q are prime to one another."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,E,Q是互素。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.21","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":22,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 21","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"334f8ef4f50d1294ff1d7a900faf1ad943484c71bd4b104327ec1123bf639f7a","citations":["euclid-7-21","euclid-7-20"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But primes are also least, [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] and the least numbers measure those which have the same ratio the same number of times, the antecedent the antecedent and the consequent the consequent; [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)] and, as E is to Q, so is P to D; therefore E measures P the same number of times that Q measures D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但质数也最少,而同样比例的最少整除次数相同,前身和相应后果;E对Q的比等于P对D的比;因此,E对整除对P的比是Q 整除对D的比；E 与 Q 之比等于 P 与 D 之比。 [[VII. 21](/principles/euclid-7-21)] [[VII. 20](/principles/euclid-7-20)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.22","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":23,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 22","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e5dc3ca06c0ccc8eabc1d05894132d5c6272e79d7fb4f5baaf0cc8a9cba47dc0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But D is not measured by any other number except A, B, C; therefore Q is the same with one of the numbers A, B, C."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但除A、B、C外,D没有用任何其他数字计量;因此,Q与A、B、C中一人相同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":24,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"7ff2ce985e68f2bdf916f07878cbed26b3922142e46d3b79c9ba7a7f7e1f60e6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it be the same with B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B也算一样吧"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.23","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":25,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 23","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"723f2e78b2dcfc02223f1e7d3a84282f76134280216e7600d570c00a439457a1","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And, however many B, C, D are in multitude, let so many E, HK, L be taken beginning from E."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"B,C,D众多, E,HK,L从E开始就被带走。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.24","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":26,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 24","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"88b21c36947eaee2a5b82f451162489329bcefe95fbf19282c0dd976485b9883","citations":["euclid-7-14"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Now E, HK, L are in the same ratio with B, C, D; therefore, ex aequali, as B is to D, so is E to L. [[VII. 14](/principles/euclid-7-14)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"现在E,HK,L与B,C,D相同;因此,从平等角度看,B对D的比例等于E对L的比例；B 与 D 之比等于 E 与 L 之比。 [[VII. 14](/principles/euclid-7-14)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.25","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":27,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 25","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"e5c5cf7a94bb00e7bb63984460201667003d1bd8b5008c1aafce34e0aed5f0d7","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore the product of B, L is equal to the product of D, E. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,B,L的产值等于D,E的产值。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.26","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":28,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 26","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d85df5f6363c3cf5e7377b41d3f431cc31c7435cb925f8d36d404786c2238098","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But the product of D, E is equal to the product of Q, P; therefore the product of Q, P is also equal to the product of B, L."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但D,E的产物等于Q,P的产物;因此,Q,P的产物也等于B,L的产物。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.27","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":29,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 27","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"a60b2e2942811ca3186837ae5ae4968f6cf162e815158cc8026926fbf8cdcb01","citations":["euclid-7-19"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore, as Q is to B, so is L to P. [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,Q比B等于L比P；Q 与 B 之比等于 L 与 P 之比。 [[VII. 19](/principles/euclid-7-19)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.28","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":30,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 28","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ed86a000a83e9401c819e1f58b76e94e4d95f82f3161eeb0b519798f44d65fd6","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And Q is the same with B; therefore L is also the same with P; which is impossible, for by hypothesis P is not the same with any of the numbers set out."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"Q和B相同,L和P也相同,这是不可能的,因为假设P和所列数字不同。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.proof.29","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":31,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 29","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"65fae21181240e67d98c7f167cbd672b24969bf7b7c4db133ab7e418b338b075","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore no number will measure FG except A, B, C, D, E, HK, L, M and the unit."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,除A、B、C、D、E、HK、L、M和单位外,没有号码整除 FG。"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.conclusion","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":32,"kind":"conclusion","title":"结论","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"39260f3345bf06f0660b3ff9da993a238a84ab432ba9536a16e375c98f981c9f","citations":["euclid-7-def-22"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And FG was proved equal to A, B, C, D, E, HK, L, M and the unit; and a perfect number is that which is equal to its own parts; [[VII. Def. 22](/principles/euclid-7-def-22)] therefore FG is perfect. Q. E. D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"FG 被证明等于A,B,C,D,E,HK,L,M和单位;完全数是等于其本身部分的;因此FG是完美的。 [[VII. Def. 22](/principles/euclid-7-def-22)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-9-36.source","contentId":"euclid-9-36","revisionId":"euclid-9-36@raw-7ee328a98df85a96","order":33,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0aeb40eb9c73e6fc89e9f73cfd748e18ab98c6500f632cbb0b703712873d92f9